# ──────────────────────────────────────────
# ML — generated vs committed
# ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Synthetic training data is regenerated by `make train`.
# Model artifacts (model.joblib, calibrator.joblib, feature_schema.json, report.md)
# ARE committed (~350 KB) so a cold clone needs no training step.
backend/ml/data/

